\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003es\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K6AedFoRpoNpcpxKxH1cLURCnge\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003erepaired\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e or \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ereplaced\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e product \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eis covered by the remainder of the original warranty period, or 90 days from the date of repair or replacement, whichever is longer.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GnW4dberSokP10xSv4rcfBF0nTd\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eIf the product cannot be \u003cspan\u003erepaired \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eand no\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e replacement is available, Anker\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e SOLIX\u003c/span\u003e will offer a partial refund based on the usage time of the defective item.\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V6fsdzSsCoQEqmxbjlyccbSfnag\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eProducts that are out of warranty \u003cspan\u003eare\u003c/span\u003e eligible for paid repair services. \u003cspan\u003eFor \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003einformation on eligible products and applicable repair costs\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, please contact \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 170, 255);\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"mailto:support@ankersolix.com\"\u003esupport@ankersolix.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W1iSdgo02oqcQtx5TK1c4VCXnWM\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-COmfdjMMuoBKvBxjrLCcTBM3nid\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCross-Regional After-Sales \u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eService\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MzBjdW6qHoAypCxjhpRcvV4tnUf\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAnker \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSOLIX \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003edoes not provide a global warranty, and the warranty service can only be obtained at designated Anker\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e SOLIX\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e repair center\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003es\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VU2SdBZTNoqLHexLobPcYDzLn98\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSubject\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e to part availability, customers whose products were \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003epurchased \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003ein another region may obtain cross-regional repair service at an additional charge. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePlease\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e note that some products do not support cross-regional repair. For more details, please contact \u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 170, 255);\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"mailto:support@ankersolix.com\"\u003esupport@ankersolix.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RQb2dpbZcof7HxxWLw2chlJHnWe\"\u003eA cross-regional replacement service is not available for \u003cspan\u003eproducts that are designed for specific regions.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EnCld1HXDoNzapxKsbccIJUYnWL\"\u003eThe customer is \u003cspan\u003eresponsible for all\u003c/span\u003e customs duties, taxes, customs clearance, and other costs incurred for cross-regional repair, regardless of whether it is \u003cspan\u003eperformed under\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e warranty or \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eas a \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003epaid