d credits can be carried forward."},{"txt":"New System Requirement: Systems must be new; used or refurbished systems are not eligible."},{"txt":"System Ownership: You must own the system. Leasing does not qualify."},{"txt":"Installation Costs: Eligible expenses include labor for installation and solar-specific components."}]},{"title":"Necessary Documents:","params":[{"txt":"Forms: Complete IRS Form 5695 and attach it to Form 1040."},{"txt":"Supporting Documentation: Keep receipts, manufacturer's certifications, proof of homeownership, and records of any utility subsidies."}]}],"desc":"Disclaimer: Given that individual circumstances may differ,Anker SOLIX cannot guarantee, assure, or make any claims regarding the availability of tax credits, deductions, or other similar benefits in relation to any of our products. The information provided here is solely for educational purposes and shall not be construed as legal, tax,regulatory, or financial advice. We highly recommend that you consult your own tax advisor to understand how this credit may apply to your personal or professional tax situation."}},{"styles":{"hideBorder":true},"iconSrc":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0854/3820/2186/files/Frame_2121235467.png?v=1747999930","title":"Need help planning your F3800 system?\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cspan style='text-decoration: underline;'\u003eGet a Free Quote Now\u003c/span\u003e","link":"https://www.ankersolix.com/free-quote-form?ref=90p_listing"}],"benefitInfo":{"icon":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0650/2773/5652/files/Frame_1973771950.png?v=1735109288","title":"Get up to 30% off the cost of qualified clean energy property with the Residential Clean Energy Credit","link":""},"solixBlackInfo":{"theme":"light","freeGiftFilterSkus":["A17A31A1","A17A41A1","A17A51A1"],"hideGetMoreSkus":[],"bgSrc":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0887/1798/4111/files/KV_480_92.jpg?v=1794297578","bgSrc_mob":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0887/1798/4111/files/KV_342_110_1f35dd52-795e-